        "The journey from home to Delhi shifts you from familiar routines into India’s vibrant pace. Delhi greets you with ancient monuments, busy streets, rich food, and layered history. Every corner reveals colour, contrast, and culture. It’s bold, energetic, and endlessly interesting—setting the tone for the journey ahead.",
